---
// Draft bio copy — written to match her vibe, meant for the baker to edit.
---
<section id="about" class="section about">
  <div class="container about__grid">
    <div class="about__photo" role="img" aria-label="A photo of the baker will go here">
      <span class="about__photo-note">a photo of the baker, coming soon</span>
    </div>

    <div class="about__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">meet the baker</p>
      <h2>Hi, I'm so glad you're here</h2>
      <p>
        I'm Rachel, the baker behind Even Butter. I make homemade cookies from my kitchen
        in North Miami with premium ingredients and plenty of good chocolate — slowly,
        carefully, and the right way. Everything is made to order in
        little batches, so each one gets a little extra love (and a lot of butter).
      </p>
      <p>
        I can't wait to share them with you. Until orders open, you can join the list below
        and I'll let you know the moment the oven's on.
      </p>
      <p class="about__pepper">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true" class="paw">
          <circle cx="6.5" cy="9.5" r="2" fill="currentColor" />
          <circle cx="11" cy="6.5" r="2" fill="currentColor" />
          <circle cx="16" cy="6.5" r="2" fill="currentColor" />
          <circle cx="18.5" cy="10.5" r="2" fill="currentColor" />
          <path d="M12 11c3 0 5 2.2 5 4.4 0 1.7-1.6 2.6-3.4 2.6-0.7 0-1.1-0.3-1.6-0.3s-0.9 0.3-1.6 0.3C9 18 7 17.1 7 15.4 7 13.2 9 11 12 11z" fill="currentColor" />
        </svg>
        <span>Quality control is handled by <strong>Pepper</strong>, my Boston Terrier and
        very serious taste-tester.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { background: var(--cream); }
  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about__photo {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    max-width: 420px;
    width: 100%;
    justify-self: center;
    background: var(--sage-soft);
    border: 2px dashed var(--cocoa-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .about__photo-note {
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--cocoa-soft);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .about__pepper svg { flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
  .about__pepper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--blush-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .paw { flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--cocoa); margin-top: 3px; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about__photo { max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto; }
  }
</style>
